dds Uber Eats to list of services for Amazon Prime members","src":"WRAL","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQd18wOW1NcUFxMFBtRndnU3hEalI1dWJ2Z0Y5cHF5X2tMRFo5MHRzVG53MjlKek1MQ0g1WG1uWlRzSnNhN1BLNnZ2XzdrMzVBZ3NNZzRsQndsQXhreFM4REg1NW1yRDVZdDhjTjFXZmRtT1BuYUxYVkxpRUR2aDUxZTBqOGF6UTdXbVdURGNSSmVCTElDeWdzV1F1VXdTTkZXQnc4WA?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"亞馬遜將 Uber Eats 優食添加到 Amazon Prime 會員服務清單中"},{"title":"Amazon-Tied Binance Contract Rises to Key Resistance","src":"TradingPedia","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxONnQzZlpsdW5sNUdnWGdGT1dfaktsMU1rUGlKMkRVYzdUMEVsTUF5R0ZSVHlOaGQtVS15bmdhejU4cU44NEQyd0xOc0lkbnhiM1hKUVNhaWIyTEU4S1lVX1pnZjMwaHRoMjc3Z2l3UXlzMkg0QnhicTRmS285UlUxZ255cHk4MXNxcUV1NmZZTzA5eURwVGVSOQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"與亞馬遜掛鉤的幣安合約遭遇關鍵阻力"},{"title":"Amazon partners with Uber Eats to bring restaurant delivery to Prime members","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"亞馬遜與 Uber Eats 優食合作，為 Prime 會員提供餐廳外送服務"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872426000004/amzn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We seek to be Earth's most customer-centric company. We are guided by four principles: customer obsession rather than competitor focus, passion for invention, commitment to operational excellence, and long-term thinking. In each of our segments, we serve our primary customer sets, consisting of consumers, sellers, developers, enterprises, content creators, advertisers, and employees.","zh":"我們致力於成為地球上最以客戶為中心的公司。我們遵循四個原則：以客戶為中心而非以競爭對手為中心、對發明的熱情、對卓越營運的承諾、長期思考。在我們的每個細分市場中，我們為主要客戶群提供服務，包括消費者、賣家、開發人員、企業、內容創作者、廣告商和員工。"},{"en":"We have organized our operations into three segments: North America, International, and Amazon Web Services (\"AWS\"). These segments reflect the way the Company evaluates its business performance and manages its operations. Information on our net sales is contained in Item 8 of Part II, \"Financial Statements and Supplementary Data — Note 10 — Segment Information.\"","zh":"我們將業務分為三個部分：北美部分、國際部分和亞馬遜網路服務（「AWS」）部分。這些部門反映了公司評估其業務績效和管理其營運的方式。有關我們淨銷售額的資訊包含在第二部分「財務報表和補充資料－附註 10—分部資訊」的第 8 項。"},{"en":"We serve consumers through our online and physical stores and focus on selection, price, and convenience. We design our stores to enable hundreds of millions of unique products to be sold by us and by third parties across dozens of product categories. Customers access our offerings through our websites, mobile apps, Alexa, devices, streaming, and physically visiting our stores. We also manufacture and sell electronic devices, including Kindle, Fire tablet, Fire TV, Echo, Ring, Blink, and eero, and we develop and produce media content. We seek to offer our customers low prices, fast and free delivery, easy-to-use functionality, and timely customer service. In addition, we offer subscription services such as Amazon Prime, a membership program that includes fast, free shipping on tens of millions of items, access to award-winning movies and series, live sports, and other benefits.","zh":"我們透過網路和實體店面為消費者提供服務，並專注於選擇、價格和便利性。我們設計商店的目的是讓我們和第三方能夠銷售數十個產品類別的數億種獨特產品。客戶透過我們的網站、行動應用程式、Alexa、裝置、串流媒體以及親自造訪我們的商店來存取我們的產品。我們也製造和銷售電子設備，包括 Kindle、Fire 平板電腦、Fire TV、Echo、Ring、Blink 和 eero，並開發和製作媒體內容。我們致力於為客戶提供低廉的價格、快速且免費的送貨、易於使用的功能以及及時的客戶服務。此外，我們還提供 Amazon Prime 等訂閱服務，這是一項會員計劃，其中包括數千萬件商品的快速免費送貨、觀看獲獎電影和連續劇、現場體育賽事以及其他福利。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our businesses encompass a large variety of product types, service offerings, and delivery channels. The worldwide marketplace in which we compete is evolving rapidly and intensely competitive, and we face a broad array of competitors from many different industry sectors around the world. Our current and potential competitors include: (1) physical, e-commerce, and omnichannel retailers, publishers, vendors, distributors, manufacturers, and producers of the products we offer and sell to consumers and businesses; (2) publishers, producers, and distributors of physical, digital, and interactive media of all types and all distribution channels; (3) web search engines, comparison shopping websites, social networks, web portals, virtual assistants, and other online and app-based means of discovering, using, or acquiring goods and services, either directly or in collaboration with other retaile","zh":"我們的業務涵蓋多種產品類型、服務產品和交付管道。我們參與競爭的全球市場正在迅速發展且競爭激烈，我們面臨來自世界各地許多不同行業的眾多競爭對手。我們目前和潛在的競爭對手包括：(1) 我們向消費者和企業提供和銷售的產品的實體、電子商務和全通路零售商、出版商、供應商、經銷商、製造商和生產商； (2) 所有類型和所有發行通路的實體、數位和互動媒體的出版商、生產商和發行商； (3) 網路搜尋引擎、比較基於商品"},{"en":"We regard our trademarks, service marks, copyrights, patents, domain names, trade dress, trade secrets, proprietary technologies, and similar intellectual property as critical to our success, and we rely on trademark, copyright, and patent law, trade-secret protection, and confidentiality and/or license agreements with our employees, customers, partners, and others to protect our proprietary rights. We have registered, or applied for the registration of, a number of U.S. and international domain names, trademarks, service marks, and copyrights. Additionally, we have filed U.S. and international patent applications covering certain of our proprietary technology.","zh":"我們認為我們的商標、服務標誌、版權、專利、網域名稱、商業外觀、商業機密、專有技術和類似智慧財產權對我們的成功至關重要，我們依靠商標、版權和專利法、商業機密保護以及與我們的員工、客戶、合作夥伴和其他人之間的保密和/或授權協議來保護我們的專有權利。我們已經註冊或申請註冊許多美國和國際網域、商標、服務標誌和版權。此外，我們也提交了涵蓋我們某些專有技術的美國和國際專利申請。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":426305000000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"International","val":161894000000,"zh":"國際"},{"name":"Amazon Web Services","val":128725000000,"zh":"亞馬遜網路服務部門"}],"total":716924000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":420658000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Online Stores","val":269287000000,"zh":"網上商店"},{"name":"Third Party Seller Services","val":172162000000,"zh":"第三方賣家服務"},{"name":"Amazon Web Services","val":128725000000,"zh":"亞馬遜網路服務"},{"name":"Advertising","val":68635000000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"Subscription Services","val":49619000000,"zh":"訂閱服務"},{"name":"Physical Stores","val":22561000000,"zh":"實體店面"},{"name":"Other Services","val":5935000000,"zh":"其他服務"}],"total":716924000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":489657000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":107467000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"DE","val":45900000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"GB","val":43212000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"JP","val":30688000000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":716924000000}},"peers":["AAPL","TSLA","GOOG","META","MSFT"]}}